{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":5},"Swing Rendez-vous","Théodore, une jeune Parisien timide, découvre l’existence d’une chanson aux pouvoirs surnaturels, un vieux standard jazz des années 20 qui agit comme un élixir d’amour sur la personne qui l’entend. Souhaitant charmer Amandine, qu’il croit être la femme de sa vie, Théodore part à la recherche de la partition. Son enquête le mène à New York, où il rencontre des musiciens de la communauté swing qui l’aideront dans son aventure.",[4],"self-employment",{"type":6,"id":7,"slug":8,"title":9,"release":11,"filmType":15,"directors":16,"genre":25,"media":29,"synopsis":32,"production":33,"characters":39,"roles":40,"awards":60,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_012","fr2023-012-swing-rendez-vous",{"native":1,"english":10},"",{"type":12,"date":13,"year":14},"Theatrical release","2023-01-11",2023,"Fiction film",[17],{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":20,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":24},"Gérome Barry","gerome-barry",1984,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[26,27,28],"Comedy","Romance","Musical",{"posterUrl":30,"trailerUrl":31},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/18/225/254226/format_page/swing-rendez-vous.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-JX1Yc8HaRk",{"native":2,"english":10},[34,36],{"country":23,"share":35},"Majority coproducer",{"country":37,"share":38},"United States of America (the)","Minority coproducer",[],[41,49,56],{"person":42,"role":48},{"id":43,"slug":44,"name":43,"birthYear":45,"deathYear":21,"gender":46,"nationality":23,"awards":47},"Arielle Dombasle","arielle-dombasle",1953,"Female identifying",[],"Minor actor/Cameo",{"person":50,"role":48},{"id":51,"slug":52,"name":51,"birthYear":53,"deathYear":54,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":55},"Bernard Pivot","bernard-pivot",1935,2024,[],{"person":57,"role":59},{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":20,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":58},[],"Director of the film"